      "rule": "7.4.95",
      "finding": "The engine substitutes short a in the abhyasa of smr before nic-can. The rule names smr among its roots and gives asasmarat. The Nyasa illustrates the common cintayam root, whereas this task is the Svadi homonym; the exact lexical scope has not been independently settled.",
